Description:

A DAV login as "user+default" (in any case) now shows only the user's
default calendar or addressbook, whatever that collection is called.
Previously it showed whichever collection was named "Default".  Any other
"user+foo" login still shows the collection named "foo".


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that log in as "user+default" to reach a collection literally
named "Default" will now see the user's default collection instead, if
those differ.


GitHub issue:

None.
